# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Security lock for the API folder.
#
# The API is meant to be served ONLY through the api.myvipclubs.com subdomain,
# whose document root is the child "public/" folder. This file blocks the main
# website (e.g. myvipclubs.com/api/...) from reaching the private files that
# live here — config.php (database password), src/ (code), and the .sql files.
#
# Apache does not read this file for the subdomain (its document root is the
# public/ subfolder below), so it does NOT block the real API — only direct
# access to this folder from other domains.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Require all denied
